<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept10081> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The study of the essential characteristics of Being in itself apart from the study of particular existing things."@en .
<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept10081> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "\u00C9tude des caract\u00E9ristiques essentielles de l'\u00CAtre en tant qu'\u00CAtre, ind\u00E9pendamment de l'\u00E9tude de choses existantes particuli\u00E8res."@fr .
