<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept1024> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The usually non-critical indication of the subject contents of a document, aiming to permit the user a decision about the relevance of the document."@en .
<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept1024> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Information g\u00E9n\u00E9ralement non-critique sur le contenu d'un document, visant \u00E0 permettre \u00E0 l'usager d'en appr\u00E9cier la pertinence."@fr .
