<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept14245> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "\u062C\u0645\u0647\u0648\u0631\u064A\u0629 \u0645\u0648\u0644\u062F\u0648\u0641\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0627\u0634\u062A\u0631\u0627\u0643\u064A\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0648\u0641\u064A\u062A\u064A\u0629"@ar .
<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept14245> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "\u0418\u0441\u043F\u043E\u043B\u044C\u0437\u0443\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044F \u043F\u043E \u043E\u0442\u043D\u043E\u0448\u0435\u043D\u0438\u044E \u043A \u0441\u043E\u0431\u044B\u0442\u0438\u044F\u043C, \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0438\u0441\u0445\u043E\u0434\u0438\u0432\u0448\u0438\u043C \u0434\u043E 1991 \u0433."@ru .
<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept14245> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use for events before 1991, otherwise, use \"Moldova R\"."@en .
<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept14245> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "S'applique \u00E0 des \u00E9v\u00E9nements survenus avant 1991, utiliser autrement \"Moldova R\"."@fr .
<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept14245> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Se aplica a eventos anteriores a 1991, en caso contrario, utilice \"Rep\u00FAblica de Moldova\"."@es .
