<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept3948> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Elements combined in minute quantities in plant or animal tissues considered essential in physiological processes."@en .
<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept3948> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "\u00C9l\u00E9ments combin\u00E9s en infimes quantit\u00E9s dans les tissus v\u00E9g\u00E9taux ou animaux, jouant un r\u00F4le essentiel dans les processus physiologiques."@fr .
