<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept4006> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Control of undesirable insects, plants or animals by the introduction of predators, parasites, or diseases."@en .
<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept4006> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Lutte contre des insectes, plantes ou animaux ind\u00E9sirables par l'introduction de pr\u00E9dateurs, parasites ou maladies."@fr .
