<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept4675> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Help given to the individual inside or outside the school system in choosing a career or occupation."@en .
<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept4675> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Aide apport\u00E9e \u00E0 un individu, dans le cadre ou \u00E0 l'ext\u00E9rieur du syst\u00E8me scolaire, pour faciliter le choix d'une carri\u00E8re ou d'un m\u00E9tier."@fr .
<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept4675> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Asistencia proporcionada a un individuo, dentro o fuera del sistema escolar, para facilitarle la elecci\u00F3n de una carrera u oficio."@es .
<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept4675> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "\u041F\u043E\u043C\u043E\u0449\u044C, \u043E\u043A\u0430\u0437\u044B\u0432\u0430\u0435\u043C\u0430\u044F \u0443\u0447\u0430\u0449\u0435\u043C\u0443\u0441\u044F \u0432 \u043F\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043B\u0430\u0445 \u0438\u043B\u0438 \u0437\u0430 \u043F\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043B\u0430\u043C\u0438 \u0448\u043A\u043E\u043B\u044C\u043D\u043E\u0439 \u0441\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0435\u043C\u044B \u0432 \u0432\u044B\u0431\u043E\u0440\u0435 \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0444\u0435\u0441\u0441\u0438\u0438."@ru .
