<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept587> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Mutual economic dependence among countries. For active efforts to promote closer economic ties, use \"economic cooperation\", \"economic integration\", etc."@en .
