<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept8121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Schools where activities, facilities or resources do not meet the basic educational needs of students."@en .
<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept8121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "\u00C9cole dont les activit\u00E9s, les \u00E9quipements ou les ressources ne r\u00E9pondent pas aux besoins \u00E9ducatifs essentiels des \u00E9l\u00E8ves."@fr .
