<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept8747> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Economy in which elements of government control are intermingled with market elements in organizing production and consumption."@en .
<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept8747> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Economie nationale marqu\u00E9e par la coexistence et la compl\u00E9mentarit\u00E9 d'une r\u00E9gulation de march\u00E9 et d'une intervention active de l'Etat dans la sph\u00E8re productive."@fr .
